  "Id": "936e4324-bea2-463a-b196-6064a2d8a6b2"/*Execute*/,
  "Description": "Executes the connected commands and then restores the graphics context. It can be used for grouping or activating and deactivating parts of graphs.\n\nSince [Execute] itself does nothing, it can also be used to label parts of a graph by inserting it and setting its instance name.\n\nSee also: [Group] (which also has a transform)",
